+	  DRM/KMS driver for the OpenCores VGA/LCD 2.0 core and register-
+	  compatible derivatives, with optional support for a line-pitch
+	  register, hardware scan doubling and a runtime-programmable
+	  pixel-clock PLL. Typically integrated in an FPGA. Bound via the
